.Dd July 9, 2026
.Dt RETICULUM-GO-X 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm reticulum-go-x , rgox , rnx
.Nd remote command execution over Reticulum
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm reticulum-go Cm x
.Op Fl l
.Op Fl x
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl config Ar dir
.Op Ar destination_hash command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Executes commands on a remote
.Nm rnx.execute
listener over an established Reticulum link.
Wire-compatible with Python
.Nm rnx
(request path
.Dq command ,
5-field request and 8-field response).
.Pp
Listen mode
.Pq Fl l
registers the handler and optionally announces.
Execute mode takes a destination hash and command.
.Fl json
emits a structured result for scripting.
.Fl m
mirrors the remote process exit code.
.Pp
Run with
.Fl h
for the full flag list.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr reticulum-go 1 ,
.Xr reticulum-go-cp 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Quad4.io
